# Portfolio React conventions

- Stack: Next.js App Router, React, TypeScript, Tailwind v4, Lucide icons.
- Theme tokens live in `app/globals.css` (`--red`, `--bg`, fonts). Keep red/black robotics look.
- All bio, jobs, projects, skills, and links come from `content/resume.md` via `lib/resume.ts`. Never hardcode resume facts in components.
- Public page: `app/page.tsx` reads markdown and passes data into section components.
- Admin: `/admin` edits the same markdown through `/api/resume` after cookie auth from `ADMIN_PASSWORD`.
- Contact form posts to `/api/contact` only. English UI copy only.
- Prefer Lucide icons for nav, social, skills, and admin actions.
